{"unit_id":"MDR-EX1000__dsh-rw#card-zh","repo":"MDR-EX1000/dsh-rw","commit":"ea7ef8a542913346f8606bc398126783ab008a84","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rw 是把 SSH 远程目录接入 DSH 的 Web 工作区插件。它通过工作区选择器、rw_* 工具和原生工具转发，让 agent 直接在远程文件系统浏览、读写和执行命令，并可比较文件、应用补丁及监看目录变化。适合需要在服务器项目中持续协作、希望沿用 DSH 操作方式的用户；使用前需要可访问的 SSH 主机和账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:36-49","src/tools.ts:488-566","src/shim.ts:1-10"]}
{"unit_id":"MDR-EX1000__dsh-rw#card-en","repo":"MDR-EX1000/dsh-rw","commit":"ea7ef8a542913346f8606bc398126783ab008a84","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-rw connects an SSH directory as a DSH web workspace. Its picker, rw_* tools and native-tool shim let an agent browse, read, edit and run commands remotely, compare files, apply patches and watch directories. It suits DSH users working in server-side projects and requires an SSH host.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:36-49","src/tools.ts:488-566","src/shim.ts:1-10"]}
